# RISE-RND

Random Network Distillation (RND) intrinsic rewards as a Safety 6-tuple env wrapper.

Install (from SpecRLBench venv):

```bash
pip install -e ../RISE-RND
```

Use via `python train/ppo_rnd_train_env.py` in SpecRLBench (wraps CMDP env, runs stock SafePO PPO).
